  "description": "\"Did we sleep together?\"   \n\"I went into the wrong room. That's all.\"\n\nShe could practically hear the sound of their twenty-year friendship cracking.  \nAnd all because of one stupid mistake that lasted a single night.\n\n\"Remember when I got disqualified at the Asian Games?\"  \n\nSageon sighed, his expression serious.\n\n\"That happened because of a jinx.\"   \n\"What kind of jinx?\"\n\nAs he continued explaining, Yuha's mind began racing.\n\n\"Hong Yuha didn't just take advantage of my body. She stole my future, too.\"  \n\"...You haven't lost your chance at a medal yet.\" \n\"What?\"\n\nIt was only a month and a half. Repeating something they'd already done wouldn't be that difficult.   \nFor the sake of Sageon's jinx, Yuha made up her mind.\n\n\"I'll take responsibility for your future.\"\n\nHong Yuha ends up becoming her childhood friend's lucky charm after a one-night mistake.  \nAnd Do Sageon? A complete lunatic whose behavior is impossible to make sense of.  \nA romantic comedy about two childhood friends whose lives become hopelessly tangled by an absurd mistake and a ridiculous jinx.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9680619), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/crazydogcum_19), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/tosa_dog)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9680822), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/crazydogcum_15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/tosa_dog_15)",
